<title>RUSSIA: Rouble falls to 5,399 per dlr in Moscow.</title>
<headline>Rouble falls to 5,399 per dlr in Moscow.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The rouble fell to 5,399 to the dollar on the Moscow Interbank Currency Exchange (MICEX) from 5,379 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>				    Sept 19		 Sept 18</p>
<p> Dollar rate		    5,399		   5,379</p>
<p> Volume traded (million $)  27.66		   17.49</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
